<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA WINS CZK 900 MLN POLISH ORDERS.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA WINS CZK 900 MLN POLISH ORDERS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech engineering concern Skoda a.s. said on Tuesday it had won three power generation equipment orders totalling 900 million Czech crowns from Poland's electrical utility Elektrim SA.</p>
</text>
